{"title": "<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Extensive vs intensive properties</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">广延性质与强度性质</span>", "slides": [{"id": "c4-extensive-intensive:title", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🔥 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Properties &amp; Changes</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">性质与变化</span></div><h2 class=\"s-title\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Extensive vs intensive properties</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">广延性质与强度性质</span></h2><p class=\"s-hook\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A gold ring and a gold bar have very different masses, yet both have exactly the same density — so which properties care about \"how much\" and which do not?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">金戒指和金条的质量差很多，密度却完全一样——哪些性质跟「有多少」有关，哪些无关？</span></span></p><div class=\"s-diff\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Difficulty</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">难度</span> <b>●○○</b></div><div class=\"s-meta\">⏱ 20 min · ★ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">essential</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">必会</span></div>"}, {"id": "c4-extensive-intensive:keys", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🔑 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Must know</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">必须记住</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Extensive vs intensive properties</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">广延性质与强度性质</span></div><ol class=\"s-list\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Extensive = depends on amount (mass, volume, length, surface area).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">广延＝与量有关（质量、体积、长度、表面积）。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Intensive = amount does not matter (density, mp, bp, colour, temperature, viscosity).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">强度＝与量无关（密度、熔点、沸点、颜色、温度、黏度）。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Test: cut it in half — value halves → E; stays the same → I.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">判断：切一半——数值减半 → 广延；不变 → 强度。</span></div></li></ol><div class=\"s-formula\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.22222em;\">V</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"s-fig\"><div class=\"cmp\"><div class=\"cmp-col l\"><div class=\"cmp-h\"><span class=\"en\">Extensive</span><span class=\"zh\"> 广延性质</span></div><div class=\"cmp-i\"><span class=\"en\">📦 changes with amount</span><span class=\"zh\"> 随量而变</span></div><div class=\"cmp-i\"><span class=\"en\">mass</span><span class=\"zh\"> 质量</span></div><div class=\"cmp-i\"><span class=\"en\">volume</span><span class=\"zh\"> 体积</span></div><div class=\"cmp-i\"><span class=\"en\">length</span><span class=\"zh\"> 长度</span></div></div><div class=\"cmp-vs\">vs</div><div class=\"cmp-col r\"><div class=\"cmp-h\"><span class=\"en\">Intensive</span><span class=\"zh\"> 强度性质</span></div><div class=\"cmp-i\"><span class=\"en\">🔒 same for any amount</span><span class=\"zh\"> 与量无关</span></div><div class=\"cmp-i\"><span class=\"en\">density</span><span class=\"zh\"> 密度</span></div><div class=\"cmp-i\"><span class=\"en\">melting point, boiling point</span><span class=\"zh\"> 熔点、沸点</span></div><div class=\"cmp-i\"><span class=\"en\">colour, temperature</span><span class=\"zh\"> 颜色、温度</span></div></div></div></div>"}, {"id": "c4-extensive-intensive:fig0", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🖼️ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Picture it</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">看图理解</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Extensive vs intensive properties</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">广延性质与强度性质</span></div><div class=\"s-fig\"><div class=\"mtree\"><ul><li><span class=\"tn d0\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Physical properties</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物理性质</span></span></span><ul><li><span class=\"tn d1\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Extensive</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">广延性质</span></span><span class=\"tn-note\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">more stuff → bigger value</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">东西越多 → 数值越大</span></span></span></span><ul><li><span class=\"tn d2\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">mass</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">质量</span></span></span></li><li><span class=\"tn d2\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">volume</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">体积</span></span></span></li><li><span class=\"tn d2\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">length, surface area</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">长度、表面积</span></span></span></li></ul></li><li><span class=\"tn d1\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Intensive</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">强度性质</span></span><span class=\"tn-note\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">amount does not matter</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">多少都一样</span></span></span></span><ul><li><span class=\"tn d2\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">density</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">密度</span></span></span></li><li><span class=\"tn d2\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">melting point, boiling point</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">熔点、沸点</span></span></span></li><li><span class=\"tn d2\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">colour, temperature, viscosity</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">颜色、温度、黏度</span></span></span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></div></div>"}, {"id": "c4-extensive-intensive:hard", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker hard\">🧗 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The hard part</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">难点</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Extensive vs intensive properties</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">广延性质与强度性质</span></div><h3 class=\"s-h\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Why density is intensive</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">为什么密度是强度性质</span></span></h3><p class=\"s-why\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A bigger object is heavier, so students think density grows too.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物体越大越重，学生就以为密度也变大。</span></span></p><ol class=\"s-steps\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Double the sample: <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">\u2192</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.22222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">\u2192</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.22222em;\">V</span></span></span></span>.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">样品加倍：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">\u2192</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.22222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">\u2192</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.22222em;\">V</span></span></span></span>。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.22222em;\">V</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.22222em;\">V</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> — unchanged.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.22222em;\">V</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.22222em;\">V</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span>——不变。</span></div></li></ol><div class=\"s-try\"><b><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Try</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">试一试</span></b> <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Water: 10 g in 10 mL, and 250 g in 250 mL. Densities?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">水：10 g 占 10 mL，250 g 占 250 mL。密度各是多少？</span></div><details><summary><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Answer</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">答案</span></summary><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Both 1.0 g/mL.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">都是 1.0 g/mL。</span></div></details></div>"}, {"id": "c4-extensive-intensive:traps", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker trap\">⚠️ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Traps &amp; tip</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">陷阱与提示</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Extensive vs intensive properties</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">广延性质与强度性质</span></div><ul class=\"s-list traps\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Temperature → extensive ✗ → intensive ✓ (a cup and a tub can both be 40 °C)</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">温度 → 广延 ✗ → 强度 ✓（一杯和一缸都可以是 40 °C）</span></div></li></ul><div class=\"s-tip\">🎯 <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Density = extensive ÷ extensive, so it is intensive.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">密度＝广延÷广延，所以是强度性质。</span></div></div>"}], "cards": [{"id": "c4-extensive-intensive.c0", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Extensive property?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">广延性质？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Depends on amount: mass, volume, length.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">与物质的量有关：质量、体积、长度。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c4-extensive-intensive.c1", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Intensive property?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">强度性质？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Does not depend on amount: density, mp, bp, colour.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">与物质的量无关：密度、熔点、沸点、颜色。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c4-extensive-intensive.c2", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Fastest test?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">最快的判断方法？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Cut the sample in half. Value halves → extensive; same → intensive.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把样品切一半。数值减半 → 广延；不变 → 强度。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c4-extensive-intensive.c3", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Temperature — E or I?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">温度——广延还是强度？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Intensive.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">强度性质。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c4-extensive-intensive.c4", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Extensive and intensive are types of which property?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">广延和强度是哪一类性质的分类？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Physical properties.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物理性质。</span></div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "c4-extensive-intensive.p1", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A property that depends on how much substance you have is called ______.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">与物质多少有关的性质叫做______性质。</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Mass and volume are examples.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">质量和体积就是例子。</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">extensive</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">广延</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Depends on amount → extensive.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">随量变化 → 广延性质。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c4-extensive-intensive.p2", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Which is an intensive property?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">下面哪个是强度性质？</span></div>", "opts": ["<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">mass</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">质量</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">volume</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">体积</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">melting point</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">熔点</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">length</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">长度</span></span>"], "a": 2, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Does a bigger ice cube melt at a higher temperature?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">冰块大了，熔化温度会更高吗？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">melting point</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">熔点</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Mass, volume and length grow with amount; melting point (0 °C for ice) does not → intensive.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">质量、体积、长度随量增大；熔点（冰为 0 °C）不变 → 强度性质。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c4-extensive-intensive.p3", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Viscosity of motor oil: extensive or intensive?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">机油的黏度：广延还是强度性质？</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Does a smaller amount flow faster?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">量少了会流得更快吗？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">intensive</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">强度性质</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Resistance to flow is the same for any amount → intensive.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">无论多少，抵抗流动的程度都一样 → 强度性质。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c4-extensive-intensive.p4", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Total length of copper wire used in a circuit: extensive or intensive?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">电路中所用铜线的总长度：广延还是强度性质？</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Add another metre of wire — what happens to the total?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">再加一米线，总长度怎样？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">extensive</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">广延性质</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Length grows with the amount of wire → extensive.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">长度随线的多少变化 → 广延性质。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c4-extensive-intensive.p5", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Boiling point of sea water: extensive or intensive? (Sea water is a mixture.)</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">海水的沸点：广延还是强度性质？（海水是混合物。）</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Being a mixture does not change the type of property.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">是混合物并不改变性质的类型。</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">intensive</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">强度性质</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Taking half of the same sea water does not change its boiling point → intensive.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">同样的海水取一半，沸点不变 → 强度性质。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c4-extensive-intensive.p6", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A 50.0 g piece of aluminum has a volume of 18.5 mL (density = mass ÷ volume). What is the density of a 25.0 g piece of the same aluminum, in g/mL (nearest hundredth)?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">一块 50.0 g 的铝体积为 18.5 mL（密度＝质量÷体积）。同样的铝取 25.0 g，它的密度是多少 g/mL（保留两位小数）？</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Is density extensive or intensive?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">密度是广延还是强度性质？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.70</span></span></span></span> g/mL</div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50.0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">\u00f7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">\u2248</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.70</span></span></span></span> g/mL. Density is intensive, so the 25.0 g piece is also 2.70 g/mL.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50.0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">\u00f7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">\u2248</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.70</span></span></span></span> g/mL。密度是强度性质，所以 25.0 g 那块也是 2.70 g/mL。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c4-extensive-intensive.p7", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A lab group records for one ice cube: mass 12 g, temperature −5 °C, colour white, volume 13 mL, melting point 0 °C. Sort all five into extensive and intensive, then say which two you would compare to show another cube is the same substance.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">一个小组记录了一块冰：质量 12 g、温度 −5 °C、白色、体积 13 mL、熔点 0 °C。把这五项分成广延和强度两类，再说明要证明另一块冰是同种物质，应该比较哪两项。</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Which values would differ for a bigger cube of the same ice?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">同样的冰换成更大一块，哪些数会变？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Extensive: mass, volume. Intensive: temperature, colour, melting point. Compare intensive ones, e.g. melting point and colour (or density).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">广延：质量、体积。强度：温度、颜色、熔点。要比较强度性质，例如熔点和颜色（或密度）。</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A bigger cube has more mass and volume → extensive. Temperature, colour, melting point do not depend on size → intensive.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">更大的冰块质量和体积更大 → 广延。温度、颜色、熔点与大小无关 → 强度。</span></div>", "whys": null}], "v": 1, "key": "topic-c4-extensive-intensive"}